# Raw extracted game assets never enter this repo. Only the DERIVED dataset does -
# rotmg-data.json and .build/sprite-atlas.png - which is what the release workflow needs
# in order to build the app at all. The 246 client XML files, spritesheetf and the Tomato
# jar stay out entirely, and live outside this folder anyway.

# Internal working notes - the project's decision log, not documentation for
# anyone installing this. Stays on the dev box.
CONTEXT.md
assets-path.txt

# .build is scratch. Exactly one file in it is a build INPUT for CI.
.build/*
!.build/sprite-atlas.png

# Build output
dist-app/
dist-standalone/
roadmap.html
node_modules/
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Never commit the updater's signing key
*.key
*.pem
